68243174378115294_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=paRS-0JrBksQ7kNvwGyZk28&_nc_oc=Adrb7UWL7XgUcoI4tVcB1xlJD01vNSv9d02ThiwxSP4tVtu-E1I4SVNddJNfPVJQtTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRj4C-wtGtL9vfbgVXs8OFSugFKy1Kh8Jlpja0qHlXfw&oe=6AEDE42F"}, {"file_name": "com.dogelabs.deadeye-20250226-230254.png", "id": "1306183940636346", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1306183943969679_6163388153480635481_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mEbhV9CsQeMQ7kNvwELWu5K&_nc_oc=Adrlu9xtDAcqXfJpCY_h_9sGSiIWQVwWy_BaHX4wYawY5bDoT1z-IwFlChpMKbCSs1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQROQMLDpMSRInY_-aKmydE2l6GJhGbT6a088xAx0HsNVw&oe=6AEE012A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Deadeye: Animal Squad", "keywords": ["gorilla", "shooter", "competitive", "combat", "guns"], "long_description": "# DEADEYE EARLY ACCESS\nDeadeye is a 5v5 hardcore tactical shooter with free flowing parkour movement. Sneak, dodge and aim your way with deadly accuracy to win. Headshots do bonus damage.\n\nTeam up with up to 4 friends and compete in 16 rounds of combat against your shell shocked opponents. \n\n# Gameplay tips:\n- Your gun is accurate only while your body is still\n- Aim for the head\n- You move quietly while moving slowly\n- Work together with your team\n- Use utility to stun or confused your opponents\n\nOnly the best will win. ", "short_description": "DEADEYE EARLY ACCESS\nDeadeye is a 5v5 hardcore tactical shooter with free flowing parkour movement. Sneak, dodge and aim your way with deadly accuracy to win. Headshots do bonus damage.\n\nTeam up with up to 4 friends in ranked matchmaking and compete in 16 rounds of combat against your shell shocked opponents. \n\nOnly the best will win. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oqEVMeNm0IpLq7EqCh0z7XfLHjpnFUVn", "developer_ter